 to connect with a tutor  and say look i want you to take me  around keith we're going to speak  ukrainian or russian whatever the case  may be  three hours in the morning maybe just  morning  and then i can study all of that and we  go back to it the next day and the next  day and the next day so and we could do  that in italian in spanish or chinese or  japanese wherever you are  sort of integrating that  one-on-one contact with a tutor and yet  then getting the sort of text of the  problems you had studying the mont link  and going back to it again the next day  anyway thank you for listening i hope it  wasn't too long  and i'll leave you with a couple of  videos where  i um  talk about ukraine and speak ukrainian  thanks for listening bye for now
 

